        "summary": "List Members",
        "description": "List members. Any active member of the account may list.\n\nExpired pending rows (`now > invite_expires_at`) are filtered out of the\nresponse and lazily deleted from Firestore when encountered - no\nseparate sweep job, per api-v2.md.",
        "operationId": "list_members_v1_accounts__account_id__members_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "account_id",
            "in": "path",
