    "/v1/workspaces/{name}": {
      "put": {
        "summary": "Create Workspace",
        "description": "Idempotent create. Caller must be an active `billing_admin` on\n`body.billing_account`.\n\nWrites `workspaces/{name}` (billing_account + members), then calls\npolicy.opteryx's genesis-grant endpoint (POL-2) for the explicit member\nlist, forwarding the caller's JWT.\n\nIdempotency: if `workspaces/{name}` already exists with the *same*\n`billing_account`/`members` as requested, this is treated as a retry -\nthe genesis call is re-attempted (policy.opteryx's own 409 in that case\njust means the earlier attempt's genesis call already succeeded, so\nthat's treated as success too), and the existing doc is returned rather\nthan erroring. If the doc exists with *different* `billing_account`/\n`members`, that's a real name conflict: 409, no genesis call made.",
        "operationId": "create_workspace_v1_workspaces__name__put",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "name",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Name"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "authorization",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "Authorization"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WorkspaceCreateRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "title": "Response Create Workspace V1 Workspaces  Name  Put"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "summary": "Delete Workspace",
        "description": "Starts the 24h soft-delete. Caller must be an active `billing_admin`\non the workspace's billing account. 423 if the workspace is currently\nlocked.\n\nDelete authority (billing_admin, here) and lock authority are\ndeliberately independent - a workspace owner with no billing-account\nrole at all can still block a billing_admin's delete by holding the\nlock, which is cleared only from SQL against the workspace\n(`ALTER WORKSPACE <name> SET deletion_protection TO OFF`), never over\nthis API. This is intentional, not an oversight worth \"fixing\" into a\nsingle permission set: billing_admin controls lifecycle/cost, workspace\nowners control operational safety, and the lock is specifically meant to\nlet an owner interpose a deliberate speed bump against a delete\ninitiated by someone who may not have day-to-day context on whether the\nworkspace is safe to remove - see api-v2.md's lock design (\"this is\nmostly about accidental [deletion]... defeating this control is about\nintent\").",
        "operationId": "delete_workspace_v1_workspaces__name__delete",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "name",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Name"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "authorization",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "Authorization"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "title": "Response Delete Workspace V1 Workspaces  Name  Delete"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/accounts/{account_id}/workspaces": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "List Account Workspaces",
        "description": "Manage-workspaces listing. Caller must be an active member of the\naccount (any role).\n\nA genuine two-database read per workspace (api-v2.md): this service's\nown `workspaces/{name}` doc for `billing_account`/`members`, plus the\n`catalogs` database's `$properties` doc (via an `OpteryxCatalog` handle)\nfor lock/delete state. Active (non-deleted) workspaces are visible to\nany account member; a soft-deleted-but-still-in-grace-period workspace\nis included only for callers who are an `owner` in that specific\nworkspace's own `members` list.",
        "operationId": "list_account_workspaces_v1_accounts__account_id__workspaces_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "account_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
